{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve an existing `UnrecoverableDurableExecutionException` instead of always replacing it with a retryable one. For example, a custom wait-for-condition SerDes can reject checkpointed state with a non-retryable control; this code changes that into `RETRYING`, potentially causing an indefinite invocation retry loop. Reuse the existing control and synthesize this wrapper only for ordinary continuation failures; test both retryable flags.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-DtZD","finding_digest":"26fae6747f3104e0bcbe9adbe89a30538650d4c8d71977c29b8af973d1b8a47c","finding_id":"arf_v1_e35om5d7gecobpf6tln6rgrqko","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::signalcontinuationfailure::retryability-preservation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::signalcontinuationfailure::retryability-preservation","line":638,"observation_digest":"a285ad7a7c597452e64ebbc70578cf1e41c4efab45652d8d5f94a2d9aba20020","observation_id":"aro_v1_ukc226t4lf2ffzsoxpdqk6gpdz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:05Z","review_id":"arr_v1_4kx76phfuc6jjlgxo4ldpuzjpc","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"05e32b6bcacefc9d71d0fb62fcfcd55e89119051","reviewer":"codex","start_line":632,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_ezv4cwoigc5hvz5hwdg5k72ljk"},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_rbkigb2kowg37dxm7mgijgdffx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:05Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
